The '''Dimensional Rift''' is a special dimension created by the [[Portal]] '''[V]''' ability. This dimension can only be escaped through the gate above the space move in the usual way. If the player is the user of the move, they can use [V] again to escape or die. When the user enters, their [[energy]] will be consumed over time.

==Appearance==
The Dimensional Rift is covered in a dark space with giant blue chains. In the center, there is a portal that serves as an exit; it appears and disappears (its disappearance does not affect the exit) and is surrounded by dark clouds and lightning. Additionally, users can see a circle icon combined with a triangle above. Right in the middle of the exit gate is an eye shape, along with electric rays and stone fragments flying upward in the center.

